{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "ROM",
  "chapter": 9,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ROM.9.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I say the truth in Christ, I lie not, my conscience also bearing me testimony in the Holy Spirit,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ROM.9.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "That I have great heaviness and continual sorrow in my heart.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ROM.9.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For I could wish that myself were accursed from Christ, for my brethren, my kinsmen according to the flesh:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ROM.9.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Who are Israelites; to whom ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "pertain",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the adoption, and the glory, and the covenants, and the giving of the law, and the service ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "of God",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", and the promises;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ROM.9.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Whose ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the fathers, and from whom according to the flesh, Christ ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "came",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", who is over all, God blessed for ever. Amen.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ROM.9.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Not as though the word of God hath taken no effect. For they ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not all Israel, who are ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "descendants",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " from Israel?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ROM.9.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Neither because they are the seed of Abraham, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are they",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " all children: but, In Isaac shall thy seed be called.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ROM.9.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "That is, They who are the children of the flesh, these ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not the children of God; but the children of the promise are counted for the seed.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ROM.9.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For this ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the word of promise, At this time will I come, and Sarah shall have a son.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ROM.9.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And not only ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "this",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": "; but when Rebecca also had conceived by one, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " by our father Isaac,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ROM.9.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "(For ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "the children",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " being not yet born, neither having done any good or evil, that the purpose of God, according to election might stand, not of works, but of him that calleth)",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ROM.9.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "It was said to her, The elder shall serve the younger.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ROM.9.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "As it is written, Jacob have I loved, but Esau have I hated.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ROM.9.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "What shall we say then? ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "Is there",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " unrighteousness with God? By no means.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ROM.9.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For he saith to Moses, I will have mercy on whom I will have mercy, and I will have compassion on whom I will have compassion.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ROM.9.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "So then, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not of him that willeth, nor of him that runneth, but of God that showeth mercy.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ROM.9.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For the scripture saith to Pharaoh, Even for this same purpose have I raised thee up, that I might show my power in thee, and that my name might be declared throughout all the earth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ROM.9.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Therefore he hath mercy on whom he will ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "have mercy",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", and whom he will he hardeneth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ROM.9.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou wilt say then to me, Why doth he yet find fault? for who hath resisted his will?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ROM.9.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "No, but, O man, who art thou that repliest against God? shall the thing formed say to him that formed ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", Why hast thou made me thus?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ROM.9.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Hath not the potter power over the clay of the same lump to make one vessel to honor, and another to dishonor?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ROM.9.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "What",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " if God, willing to show ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "his",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " wrath, and to make his power known, endured with much long-suffering the vessels of wrath fitted to destruction:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ROM.9.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And that he might make known the riches of his glory on the vessels of mercy, which he had before prepared for glory,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ROM.9.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Even us whom he hath called, not of the Jews only, but also of the Gentiles.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ROM.9.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "As he saith also in Hosea, I will call them My people, who were not my people; and her Beloved, who was not beloved.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ROM.9.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And it shall come to pass, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in the place where it was said to them, Ye ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not my people; there shall they be called, The children of the living God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ROM.9.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Isaiah also crieth concerning Israel, Though the number of the children of Israel be as the sand of the sea, a remnant shall be saved:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ROM.9.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For he will finish the work, and cut ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " short in righteousness: because a short work will the Lord make upon the earth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ROM.9.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And as Isaiah said before, Except the Lord of Sabaoth had left us a seed, we had been as Sodom, and been made like Gomorrah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.30",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ROM.9.30",
      "verse": 30,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "What shall we say then? That the Gentiles who followed not after righteousness, have attained to righteousness, even the righteousness which is by faith:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.31",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ROM.9.31",
      "verse": 31,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But Israel, who followed after the law of righteousness, hath not attained to the law of righteousness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.32",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ROM.9.32",
      "verse": 32,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Why? Because ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "they sought it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not by faith, but as it were by the works of the law. For they stumbled at that stumbling-stone;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.33",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ROM.9.33",
      "verse": 33,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "As it is written, Behold, I lay in Sion a stumbling-stone, and rock of offense: and whoever believeth on him shall not be ashamed.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
